sequenceDiagram
  autonumber

  actor L as Lecturer
  participant UI as Web UI
  participant Course as Course API
  participant RAG as RAG Service
  participant DB as Database

  L->>UI: Request generation (topicTitle)
  activate UI
  UI->>Course: Start RAG pipeline
  activate Course

  Course->>DB: Load course materials metadata
  activate DB
  DB-->>Course: Materials list / empty
  deactivate DB

  alt [materials exist]
    Course->>RAG: Extract learning outcomes + relevant content
    activate RAG
    RAG-->>Course: Extracted context
    deactivate RAG

    Course-->>UI: Context ready
  else [materials missing]
    Course-->>UI: 409 Conflict (materials not uploaded)
  end

  deactivate Course
  deactivate UI
